
=== bmcctl Arch installer ===

This ISO auto-installs Arch Linux when it boots from the BMC's
virtual media. Watch progress on this serial console (SOL).

If you are reading this from a login prompt, the installer either
finished successfully (in which case the host has been told to
poweroff and the BMC should report PowerState=Off shortly) OR the
installer failed and dropped to a shell so you can debug.

Install log: /var/log/bmcctl-install.log
Configuration: /root/install-config.env
Installer script: /root/install.sh

To re-run the install manually:
  systemctl restart bmcctl-installer.service
  journalctl -fu bmcctl-installer.service

